    "answer": {
      "short": "12",
      "worked": "$A$ contains 10 whole numbers. $B$ contains 7 even numbers. Their intersection contains the 5 even numbers from 1 to 10.\n$$\\begin{aligned}|A\\cup B|&=|A|+|B|-|A\\cap B|\\\\&=10+7-5\\\\&=12\\end{aligned}$$",
